# Unreal build output
Binaries/
Intermediate/
Saved/
DerivedDataCache/

# Files UE writes under Build/ when packaging. Anything else in Build/ (e.g. a PakDenylist) stays tracked.
# src/ and project.properties are regenerated on every Android package; FileOpenOrder/ is cook output.
Build/Android/src/
Build/Android/project.properties
Build/*/FileOpenOrder/
Build/Android/res/

